---
---

<section id="cta-qui-sommes-nous" class="container-content px-4 py-32 sm:px-6 lg:py-40">
  <div class="reveal-group mx-auto flex max-w-2xl flex-col items-center gap-6 text-center">
    <p class="kicker">Pour aller plus loin</p>
    <h2 class="cta-title">Découvrez Jeune Chrétien en action.</h2>
    <p class="text-ink/70">
      Explorez nos différents domaines d'intervention et découvrez les
      contenus que nous mettons à la disposition des jeunes.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="/ce-que-nous-faisons" class="btn-primary">Ce que nous faisons</a>
      <a href="/blog" class="btn-secondary">Notre blog</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  section {
    scroll-margin-top: 6.5rem;
  }

  .kicker {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.3rem + 2vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .btn-primary,
  .btn-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding-inline: 1.75rem;
    padding-block: 0.875rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    transition:
      filter 150ms var(--ease-out-site),
      background-color 150ms var(--ease-out-site),
      outline-color 150ms var(--ease-out-site);
    outline: 2px solid transparent;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-on-fill);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    filter: brightness(0.88);
  }
  .btn-primary:focus-visible {
    outline-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 6%, transparent);
  }
  .btn-secondary:focus-visible {
    outline-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
</style>
